{
  "mn102:0.1": "Majjhima Nikāya 102 ",
  "mn102:0.2": "Pañcattayasutta ",
  "mn102:1.1": "Evaṁ me sutaṁ—",
  "mn102:1.2": "ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā sāvatthiyaṁ viharati jetavane anāthapiṇḍikassa ārāme. ",
  "mn102:1.3": "Tatra kho bhagavā bhikkhū āmantesi: ",
  "mn102:1.4": "“bhikkhavo”ti. ",
  "mn102:1.5": "“Bhadante”ti te bhikkhū bhagavato paccassosuṁ. ",
  "mn102:1.6": "Bhagavā etadavoca: ",
  "mn102:2.1": "“santi, bhikkhave, eke samaṇabrāhmaṇā aparantakappikā aparantānudiṭṭhino aparantaṁ ārabbha anekavihitāni adhivuttipadāni abhivadanti. ",
  "mn102:2.2": "‘Saññī attā hoti arogo paraṁ maraṇā’ti—",
  "mn102:2.3": "ittheke abhivadanti; ",
  "mn102:2.4": "‘asaññī attā hoti arogo paraṁ maraṇā’ti—",
  "mn102:2.5": "ittheke abhivadanti; ",
  "mn102:2.6": "‘nevasaññīnāsaññī attā hoti arogo paraṁ maraṇā’ti—",
  "mn102:2.7": "ittheke abhivadanti; ",
  "mn102:2.8": "sato vā pana sattassa ucchedaṁ vināsaṁ vibhavaṁ paññapenti, diṭṭhadhammanibbānaṁ vā paneke abhivadanti. ",
  "mn102:2.9": "Iti santaṁ vā attānaṁ paññapenti arogaṁ paraṁ maraṇā, sato vā pana sattassa ucchedaṁ vināsaṁ vibhavaṁ paññapenti, diṭṭhadhammanibbānaṁ vā paneke abhivadanti. ",
  "mn102:2.10": "Iti imāni pañca hutvā tīṇi honti, tīṇi hutvā pañca honti—",
  "mn102:2.11": "ayamuddeso pañcattayassa. ",
  "mn102:3.1": "Tatra, bhikkhave, ye te samaṇabrāhmaṇā saññiṁ attānaṁ pañ